## 思路

**变长滑动窗口**:右指针扩展直到窗口涵盖 `t`,左指针收缩到不能再缩,记录最短。用 `need` 哈希表 + `needCnt`(还缺的字符总数)判断是否涵盖;`needCnt === 0` 时尝试收缩。

## 参考代码

```js
function minWindow(s, t) {
  if (s.length < t.length) return '';
  const need = new Map();
  for (const c of t) need.set(c, (need.get(c) || 0) + 1);
  let needCnt = t.length;
  let l = 0;
  let start = 0;
  let minLen = Infinity;
  for (let r = 0; r < s.length; r++) {
    const c = s[r];
    if (need.has(c)) {
      if (need.get(c) > 0) needCnt--;
      need.set(c, need.get(c) - 1);
    }
    while (needCnt === 0) {
      if (r - l + 1 < minLen) { minLen = r - l + 1; start = l; }
      const d = s[l];
      if (need.has(d)) {
        need.set(d, need.get(d) + 1);
        if (need.get(d) > 0) needCnt++;
      }
      l++;
    }
  }
  return minLen === Infinity ? '' : s.slice(start, start + minLen);
}
```

## 复杂度

- 时间:O(n)
- 空间:O(k),k 为字符集大小
